* The boardwalk over the pool in the east caves (room 44, x 4800-5700;
* owner, 2026-11-09): its floor line bowed up toward both ends, about 28 px
* above the level planks there, so creatures and the potted bush near the
* ends stood in the air over them. It now runs flat along the planks (y
* 2285) from x 4880 to 5620, rising only at the ends to meet the banks at
* their old heights (2255).
ssfc 44 4 0 40 80 10 820 10 900 40
